#! ia 1.0

@schema system
  lowers to definition
  sections
    may have discriminators
    may have requires
    may have edges
    may have relationships
    open
  fields
    must have head.provider as text
    must have head.version as text
    may have head.steward as ref
    may have head.describes as text

@schema schema
  lowers to contract
  sections
    must have sections
    may have fields
    may have edges
    closed
